SUMMARY:Neverness to Everness Version 1.4 Update "For Whom the Verses Mourn" Preview Special Program
DESCRIPTION:Publisher Perfect World Games and developer Hotta Studio will host the free-to-play supernatural urban open-world action RPG Neverness to Everness Version 1.4 Update “For Whom the Verses Mourn” Preview Special Program on September 16 at 4:30 a.m. PT / 7:30 a.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English\, Japanese\, Korean) and Twitch.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/neverness-to-everness-version-1-4-update-for-whom-the-verses-mourn-preview-special-program
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_NTE_09-16-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
