SUMMARY:devINITIVE Showcase 2026
DESCRIPTION:devINITIVE Showcase 2026 will take place on  September 16 at 12:00 p.m. PT / 3:00 p.m. ET. You will be able to watch it on YouTube and Twitch. \nThe two-hour broadcast will feature a selection of independent Spanish and Latin American video games\, including world premieres\, exclusive demos\, and release dates. The organization team selected games from more than 250 submissions received\, resulting in a final lineup of around 90 titles.
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/devinitive-showcase-2026
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_devINITIVE-Showcase-26_09-16-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
