SUMMARY:Persona 4 Revival Broadcast: September 19\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:ATLUS will host the special program “Persona 4 Revival Broadcast” on September 19 at 4:00 p.m. PT / 7:00 p.m. ET / June 19 at 08:00 JST\, where it will dive deeper into the Investigation Team and brand-new features. You will be able to watch it on YouTube (English\, Japanese).
