SUMMARY:Persona 30th Anniversary Special Live Stream
DESCRIPTION:ATLUS will host the Persona 30th Anniversary Special Live Stream on September 20 at 19:30 JST. You will be able to watch it on YouTube. \nThe broadcast will celebrate the Persona series’ 30th anniversary with talks and live performances\, as well as feature a Tokyo Game Show 2026 edition of the “Persona 30th Anniversary Merchandise and Event News Channel.”  \nPresenters include host Neki Matsuzawa (Chiaki Matsuzawa) and ugests Daisuke Namikawa (voice actor for the Protagonist of Persona 4)\, Jun Fukuyama (voice actor for the Protagonist of Persona 5)\, Shiori Sasaki (Persona 4 singer)\, Lyn (Persona 5 singer)\,  Azumi Takahashi (Persona 3 Reload singer)\, and Lotus Juice (Persona 3 singer).
URL:https://www.gematsu.com/event/persona-30th-anniversary-special-live-stream
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.gematsu.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Event_Persona-30th_09-20-26.jpg
END:VEVENT
